  "translation": "Gomme banna ka moka ba Yehuda ba araba kgahlanong le banna ba Yisraele: ka gobane kgoši ⟨ke⟩ yo a kgauswi le nna; gomme ke ka baka eng go tuka pela go wena ka taba ye? Na go ja re jele go tšwa go kgoši, goba ra amogela mpho go rena?",
